cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "mip-mp: Rigid Body Path Planning using Mixed-Integer Linear Programming"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of a three-stage rigid-body path planner: the free
  workspace is decomposed into a graph of collision-free convex polytopes, many
  small mixed-integer linear programs certify paths between neighbouring
  polytopes offline, and start/goal queries are answered online by graph search.
